   "emo": "worried",
   "text": "Come on... *whistle*.",
   "t": 1.2
  },
  {
   "id": "d1",
   "char": "dad",
   "emo": "stern",
   "text": "Dinner?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "m1",
   "char": "mom",
   "emo": "calm",
   "text": "Almost. It's just... slow today.",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "id": "d2",
   "char": "dad",
   "emo": "annoyed",
   "text": "Slow.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "k0",
   "char": "kimu",
   "emo": "worried",
   "text": "Mom... that *hiss*.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "m2",
   "char": "mom",
   "emo": "sad",
   "text": "Fifteen years. Never *slow*.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "d3",
   "char": "dad",
   "emo": "stern",
   "text": "Buy a new one.",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "m3",
   "char": "mom",
   "emo": "sad",
   "text": "My mother gave me *this* one.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "k1",
   "char": "kimu",
   "emo": "warm",
   "text": "Give me five minutes.",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "n2",
   "char": "kimu",
   "emo": "whisper",
   "text": "Please... help me see it.",
   "t": 20.4
  },
  {
   "id": "n3",
   "char": "narrator",
   "emo": "narrate",
   "text": "Inside a sealed pot, steam can't escape. So the pressure builds.",
   "t": 28.3
  },
  {
   "id": "n4",
   "char": "narrator",
   "emo": "narrate",
   "text": "More pressure means hotter water. That's why a cooker is so fast.",
   "t": 33.0
  },
  {
   "id": "n5",
   "char": "narrator",
   "emo": "narrate",
   "text": "The whistle? That's the steam finally lifting the weight.",
   "t": 37.8
  },
  {
   "id": "n6",
   "char": "narrator",
   "emo": "narrate",
   "text": "No whistle means the steam is leaking somewhere else.",
   "t": 42.0
  },
  {
   "id": "n7",
   "char": "narrator",
   "emo": "narrate",
   "text": "First, flame off. Let the pressure drop. Always.",
   "t": 46.3
  },
  {
   "id": "n8",
   "char": "narrator",
   "emo": "narrate",
   "text": "Dried starch on the rim. The seal couldn't seal.",
   "t": 50.0
  },
  {
   "id": "m4",
   "char": "mom",
   "emo": "relieved",
   "text": "There it is.",
   "t": 54.2
  },
  {
   "id": "d4",
